Description: Implements ordinary least squares linear regression from scratch using linear algebra.
  The package uses an object-oriented system to support S3 methods including print(),
  summary(), plot(), coef(), residuals() and pred(). A vignette demonstrates regression
  analysis with the iris dataset.
